    <bpmn:process id="W_W4081" name="W4081. Change Communications Strategy, Messaging &amp; Channel Plan" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Initiative charter; major milestone
Frequency: Per initiative + ongoing
Volume: Per major initiative (audiences: ~6,932 employees, vendors, B2B customers, board)
Owner: OCM Lead / Corporate Comms (links to VS-14.3)
Participants: Comms (VS-14.3/VS-103.1), Internal Comms, sponsor, HR (VS-103)
Source: workflow W4081 — Change Communications Strategy, Messaging &amp; Channel Plan</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4081_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4081_Lane1" name="OCM">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4081_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4081_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4081_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4081_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4081_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4081_Start3" name="Initiative charter; major milestone">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4081_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4081_Task4" name="OCM/Comms build the comms strategy: the change story/vision, key messages by…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: OCM/Comms build the comms strategy: the change story/vision, key messages by audience and phase (awareness→understanding→adoption→sustainment), channels (town hall, huddle, app, email, video, store signage), and cadence
Responsible (R): OCM / Internal Comms
Accountable (A): OCM Lead
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4081_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4081_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4081_Task5" name="OCM/Comms align messaging with corporate comms (VS-14.3) and store comms/task…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: OCM/Comms align messaging with corporate comms (VS-14.3) and store comms/task (VS-63), ensure two-way channels (Q&amp;A, feedback), and pre-clear regulatory/legal-sensitive messaging (links to VS-22/VS-100)
Responsible (R): OCM / Comms / Legal
Accountable (A): OCM Lead
Duration: Per initiative</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4081_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4081_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4081_Task6" name="OCM/Comms execute, measure reach/understanding, and adjust">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: OCM/Comms execute, measure reach/understanding, and adjust
Responsible (R): OCM / Comms
Accountable (A): Sponsor
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4081_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4081_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4081_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4081_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4081_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-633 (ensure controlled execution — Change Delivery, Communications &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-134.2).) | - CTL-633: legal/compliance pre-clearance for sensitive messaging
Owner: OCM Lead / Corporate Comms (links to VS-14.3)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
