    <bpmn:process id="W_W4082" name="W4082. Transformation Roadmap, Sequencing &amp; Change Saturation Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Portfolio planning; dependency/conflict
Frequency: Quarterly + on change
Volume: Enterprise transformation roadmap
Owner: CHRO / PMO (VS-112)
Participants: PMO (VS-112), sponsors, function VPs, workforce planning (VS-103.3)
Source: workflow W4082 — Transformation Roadmap, Sequencing &amp; Change Saturation Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4082_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4082_Lane1" name="CHRO">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4082_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4082_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4082_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4082_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4082_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4082_Start3" name="Portfolio planning; dependency/conflict">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4082_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4082_Task4" name="CHRO/PMO maintain the integrated transformation roadmap (dependencies…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: CHRO/PMO maintain the integrated transformation roadmap (dependencies, milestones, change windows), and sequence initiatives to manage change load (links to W4074)
Responsible (R): CHRO / PMO
Accountable (A): Transformation Board
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4082_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4082_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4082_Task5" name="CHRO monitor change saturation by audience (survey links to W4077, capacity…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: CHRO monitor change saturation by audience (survey links to W4077, capacity W4074), and re-sequence/defer to avoid overload, protecting peak retail periods (links to VS-07)
Responsible (R): CHRO / HR
Accountable (A): CEO / COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4082_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4082_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4082_Task6" name="CHRO communicate the roadmap so the organization sees the bigger picture and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: CHRO communicate the roadmap so the organization sees the bigger picture and what&#x27;s coming
Responsible (R): CHRO / Comms
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4082_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4082_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4082_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4082_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
