        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-633 (ensure controlled execution — Change Delivery, Communications &amp; Stakeholder Engagement (PA-134.2).) | - CTL-633: transformation-board sequencing approval; change-window policy
Owner: CHRO / PMO (VS-112)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
